❯ cat .gemini/antigravity-cli/hooks.json
{
  "test": {
    "PreInvocation": null,
    "PostInvocation": null,
    "Stop": [
      {
        "type": "command",
        "command": "echohooks1234",
        "timeout": 0
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": null,
    "PostToolUse": null
  }
}`

Can you use the agy cli (can you do it interactively?) and try to figure out what we would need to build to have an agent integration for antigravity with our usual hooks setup?

